 "remarks": "Investors welcome! Low HOA fees of just $220.65. Move-in ready with recent updates, this inviting condo offers a comfortable living space with natural light and a welcoming feel. The interior features a nicely sized kitchen, a dedicated dining area combined with a comfortable living room, and a bonus room that offers additional space for an office, playroom, or other needs. Convenient washer and dryer connections are located in the updated bathroom, adding everyday functionality. Right outside the bedroom, you can enjoy a beautiful patio area or relax in the community swimming pool that is located nearby in the next building. This is a well-maintained complex and is conveniently located near Norwalk Hospital, shopping, restaurants, and public transportation, with access to major highways for an easy commute.",
